            "review_title": "Review at TC Wine & Dining",
            "review_text": "Tiny Moon\n5 contributions\n0\nGreat place for a night out right in Tan Binh District!!!\nJan 2023\nWe went here with our friends and kids, the restaurant is quite nice with beautiful and very chill environment. Although its the brand new restaurant in town, we super surprised with the food and drinks here, can be compare with high-end Western restaurant in Dist.1 or 2. Now we have another option near our home in Dist.3 and the Airport and don't have to experience the heavy traffic jam during Holiday. Thanks God for that.\nThe chef here is quite skillful, but the staffs are abit shy talking to us while ordering, maybe cuz they're new but still acceptable, they were really helpful after all. \nOur kids are in love with the French-fries and snacks here, we have to orders 3 times! The Beef Wellington is Chef recommend dishes and it was really good tase, we also tried other main dishes and really enjoyed them. We only order 02 Sangrias and 01 bottle of wine to share, total bills is reasonable and worth the price.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 12, 2023",
